{"generatedAt":"2026-11-21T17:53:19.418Z","answers":[{"id":"4GrdOGiA7N06srA1Gj2M","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":15,"answerContent":"means believing in the Three Jewels: the Buddha, the Dhamma, and the Sangha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:02:26.391Z"},{"id":"64KUTnYoQz21yZ2wvXCD","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":14,"answerContent":"taking refuge in the three jewels: the Buddha, the Dhamma (his teachings), and the Sangha (the community of monks).","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:00:06.017Z"},{"id":"6eXjsQYcRCoxr8BXhDih","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":9,"answerContent":"They didn't know who was the disciple and who was the teacher.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T22:02:50.958Z"},{"id":"8oM4OpkV1aa9UGlfNFYt","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":5,"answerContent":"they are praying to the Buddha and listening to his teachings","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:36:07.384Z"},{"id":"9h4GDY70tC2vJT4pTPY4","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":9,"answerContent":"They felt doubtful and wondered who was the teacher and who was the disciple","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:45:43.676Z"},{"id":"APXjsaSwCVc6ICeAThnQ","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"Because King Bimbisara asked him to when he attained Buddhahood.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:53:27.496Z"},{"id":"AliPQdA0muIXN88xxPxO","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":7,"answerContent":"1000 Arahants/ Disiples came to Rajaha together with the Buddha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:42:06.150Z"},{"id":"B9IxRir4HwXDMvybf7wx","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":22,"answerContent":"they must practice discipline by keeping the Five Precepts in daily life. They must also honor the Buddha, study and follow the Dhamma, and support and respect the Sangha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:17:22.887Z"},{"id":"BtjRLmcepyIuowbYxq18","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":1,"answerContent":"I solved a problem once by talking it out with the other person.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T20:50:24.356Z"},{"id":"Cyq6sPpI8GCn387Y51XZ","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":12,"answerContent":"To become king of the Magada realm, for the Buddha to visit his realm, to respectfully honor and serve the Buddha, to hear teachings leading to Nibbana from the Buddham, and to fully understand and realize those teachings","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:55:50.160Z"},{"id":"Cys7KvmPFn40BxP7KCRV","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":8,"answerContent":"King Bimbisara and 120000 Bramin householders came!","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:43:38.806Z"},{"id":"EIl3pxE4RqhsQhSpzoHf","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":17,"answerContent":"because he is fully enlightened and free from all evil. He shows us the true path to end suffering and find peace.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:08:05.900Z"},{"id":"PbrdkiL3PLmxZ4b7WWwj","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":2,"answerContent":"Yes.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T20:51:47.799Z"},{"id":"SX4QyT6Uqvi5yrZy75Ff","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":4,"answerContent":"it is the Buddha and his 500 disciples","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:33:38.900Z"},{"id":"WFHIqxkAuC2gQfjtwJTz","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"Because of a promise made earlier","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:40:41.986Z"},{"id":"WKlMnAXMzmXIJnOWzfUx","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":7,"answerContent":"A thousand monks.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:59:51.961Z"},{"id":"cVU0hlkTbS0tVfjuTTwK","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":5,"answerContent":"They are bowing before and worshiping the Buddha, because they know he is the Enlightened one and wish to learn from his teachings.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:46:06.087Z"},{"id":"ewvXhf8WtyeR2FDAiMUm","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":13,"answerContent":"he requested to be recognized as a lay follower for life and invited the Buddha and his monks for an alms meal","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:56:51.177Z"},{"id":"ipJvK2xrztr9PMJSHyr5","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":19,"answerContent":"because they follow the Buddha's teachings and teach them to us. They guide us to do good deeds and keep Dhammas teachings alive.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:10:25.034Z"},{"id":"jeU5bbf2JsOC2DF3Xo82","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":1,"answerContent":"To show a proud hermit named Kassapa the truth, the Buddha tamed a dangerous serpent and performed many miracles. When Kassapa still stayed proud, the Buddha gently told him he was not truly enlightened. Realizing his mistake, Kassapa and his 500 followers joined the Buddha and became enlightened.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:26:50.504Z"},{"id":"ksCSS53z8Gw7j2FNpNxf","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":8,"answerContent":"King Bimbisara and one hundred, twenty thousand wealthy brahmins.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T22:00:57.062Z"},{"id":"mjibIanM1RyfRcBnw1GP","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"to clear the doubts the Buddha asked Uruvela about his fire worship, leading Kassapa to bow at the Buddhas feet and declare himself a disciple. the Buddha then preached the Dhamma to King Bimbisara and the 120000 Bramin householders.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:49:54.167Z"},{"id":"onHGV9WCgYqsCLxmCh20","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":18,"answerContent":"by following it, we can live a good life, avoid bad deeds, and reach ultimate peace.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:08:51.880Z"},{"id":"sC5pn7tGK8NNmgh6maQt","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":3,"answerContent":"He was a prominent king who was close friend and protector of the Buddha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:44:49.580Z"},{"id":"sc0M0jbuOYQyd3PSVaXV","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":4,"answerContent":"The Buddha and his disciples.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:45:07.219Z"},{"id":"uUTFZE1WEcwIBT4pmAbM","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":20,"answerContent":"protects us from falling into bad realms like hell, animals, and ghosts after death. It brings peace of mind in this life and helps us earn great merit","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:13:02.526Z"},{"id":"un0Oj5rryAWrWpr0fj2h","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":2,"answerContent":"he was a famous ruler of the Magadha kingdom","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:27:54.085Z"},{"id":"wwXhMe0iW0KzeTBvhhOp","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":16,"answerContent":"There are three refuges in total: taking refuge in the Buddha, the Dhamma, and the Sangha. This means choosing the Buddha as the teacher and his teachings as the guide.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:06:04.857Z"},{"id":"yC1gJma8PYgSscU6KLt3","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":11,"answerContent":"King Bimbisara and 110000 Bramin householders","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:50:59.724Z"},{"id":"yTrq5iDRNhdcq0LvjtD6","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":3,"answerContent":"he was one of the Buddhas most important royal patrons.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:28:51.266Z"},{"id":"zbIuiFV2YvR8Kn3nXw3q","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Lily htike","userId":"TQaPTCf1pZP3rRsn8L0J7VaJ78f1","questionIndex":21,"answerContent":"a layperson who firmly takes refuge in the Three Jewels","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:16:35.142Z"},{"id":"vKnoVWDEJMeWnQg3EbrF","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"The Buddha preached the Dhamma to King Bimbisara and the hundred and twenty thousand brahmins after asking if Uruvela Kassapa still practiced his old fire offerings.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:51:46.159Z"},{"id":"cp2wx0ac97W0YorSaG5i","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":11,"answerContent":"King Bimbisara and the hundred and twenty thousand brahmins.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:53:45.163Z"},{"id":"0NeaP1X3NLjzVuCyueFb","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":12,"answerContent":"To become king of Magadha, to have the Blessed One come to his country, to pay homage to the Blessed One, to hear the Dhamma from the Blessed One about the attainment of Nirvana, and to understand the Dhamma clearly.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:54:56.042Z"},{"id":"RQsHrRcRWtt8BQfklqMr","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":13,"answerContent":"He offered the Veluvana Garden to the Buddha and the Sangha at the alms-giving ceremony.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:56:03.451Z"},{"id":"wuIvyVccp59T6DgrtrzJ","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":14,"answerContent":"Yes, there are 3 triple gems praised in it.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:56:34.475Z"},{"id":"VAqdcXJLPh4FTHpdWWY5","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":15,"answerContent":"To praise the triple gems.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:57:02.725Z"},{"id":"YIsmjzk7Tc5xuAoAJH2b","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":16,"answerContent":"Buddham saranam gisaami - I take refuge in the Buddha.\nDhammam saranam gisaami - I take refuge in the Dhamma.\nSangham saranam gisaami - I take refuge in the Sangha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:57:49.239Z"},{"id":"zXRT8U2H6oOrS4Ib2YWB","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":17,"answerContent":"To follow his teachings and reach Nirvana.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:58:24.305Z"},{"id":"ycBwLhlMoD5PAkaTKmna","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":18,"answerContent":"To learn how to reach enlightenment and Nirvana.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:58:40.161Z"},{"id":"56N41cHhx5SM9WQYrqpQ","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":19,"answerContent":"To honor the disciples of the Buddha and learn the dharma from them.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:59:16.291Z"},{"id":"kIUcXYrgN5S3UouuMutL","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":20,"answerContent":"You earn good karma and will live a better life peacefully.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:59:35.357Z"},{"id":"MqDgPcbEOqyEYTUMXgdi","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":21,"answerContent":"A person who devotes their lives to the dharma.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:59:59.866Z"},{"id":"WcUCur6KIvdXFEYVb3uA","lessonId":"FSAg0AXg6KJJpseHqzD7","studentName":"Mabel Naing","userId":"8TcvCYBwIFaG1ok7w6w9iQX3Gca2","questionIndex":22,"answerContent":"Recite the saranagon everyday and do good deeds every day.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-11-20T22:00:25.412Z"}]}